  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Siché lost everything to her stepsister, Roena. Love, reputation, and family all shattered like a broken glass slipper. She was framed as Cinderella’s evil stepsister, hated for merely existing in high society. Her resentful last words should have been the end of her suffering... But the reality was far more devastating. Siché had traveled back in time to the day she met Roena. This time, Siché will quench her thirst for vengeance. After all, the glass slippers were never meant for her anyway.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
